OL,3,GNEWSAMan who failed GCSEs graduates
OL,4,Afrom uni aged 42
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who decided to retake his English
OL,7,FGCSE after failing it as a teenager has
OL,8,Fgraduated from university at the age of
OL,9,F42.
OL,11,FDavid Spelman from Topsham in Devon has
OL,12,Fgraduated from the University of Exeter
OL,13,Fwith a degree in history, after
OL,14,Fretaking his GCSE three years ago.
OL,16,FSpelman retook his English exam as his
OL,17,Fgrades were not good enough to be
OL,18,Faccepted by the university where he had
OL,19,Fheld a lifelong ambition to study
OL,20,Fhistory.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
