OL,3,GNEWSAMan who failed GCSEs graduates
OL,4,Afrom uni aged 42
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe encouraged anyone thinking about
OL,7,Freturning to education to "go for it"
OL,8,Fand said "if I can do it anyone can".
